<view class="staff-page has-foot"><view class="content"><include src="/templates/subject.wxml" /><view wx:if="{{!success}}"><view class="card"><view class="card-head"><text class="card-title">任务摘要</text><text class="tag tag-green">交接完成</text></view><view class="row gap10"><view class="avatar lg a2">糯</view><view class="grow"><view class="t15 strong">{{d.petName}}</view><view class="t12 muted mt4">布偶猫 · 客户 {{d.customerName}}</view></view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="kv"><text class="k">订单编号</text><text class="v">{{d.orderNo}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="k">客户姓名</text><text class="v">{{d.customerName}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="k">接送类型</text><text class="v orange strong">接宠</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="k">接送时间</text><text class="v">2026-11-06 16:00</text></view></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">核销项目</text><text class="tag tag-gray">固定项目 · 不可更改</text></view><view class="card"><view class="row gap10"><view class="avatar a3"><text class="ico">⌖</text></view><view class="grow"><view class="t14 strong">接送</view><view class="t11 muted mt4">本趟：接宠 · 1 次</view></view><text class="tag tag-orange">本项目</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="t11 muted">本页仅核销接送服务，不提供洗护、遛宠等其他项目选择。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-head"><text class="card-title">服务凭证</text><text class="card-sub">点击查看照片详情</text></view><view class="photo-grid"><view class="photo filled" wx:for="{{photos.p1.items}}" wx:key="uid" bindtap="previewPhoto" data-key="p1" data-url="{{item.url}}"><image wx:if="{{item.url}}" class="photo-img" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFill" /><text wx:else class="photo-mark">爪</text><text class="photo-badge" wx:if="{{item.badge}}">{{item.badge}}</text><text class="photo-wm">{{item.wm}}</text><text class="photo-del" catchtap="removePhoto" data-key="p1" data-index="{{index}}">×</text></view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="card-head"><text class="card-title">核销信息</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="k">司机姓名</text><text class="v">{{meName}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="k">核销时间</text><text class="v">2026-11-06 16:38（提交时写入）</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="k">任务状态</text><text class="v ok">交接完成 · 待核销</text></view></view></view><view class="success show" wx:if="{{success}}"><view class="success-icon"></view><view class="success-title">接送服务核销成功</view><view class="success-desc">核销后自动写入服务记录，对应待办任务自动消失。</view><button class="btn btn-outline" bindtap="toastMsg" data-msg="请从工作台选择对应订单后操作">返回工作台</button></view></view><view class="footer" wx:if="{{!success}}"><button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{readOnly||submitting}}" loading="{{submitting}}">确认核销（仅接送）</button></view></view>